      "body": "**Closed as integrated via #1450** (squash-merged to main as `000b41c6`), under the owner's instruction to clear the PR backlog. This PR's head is an ancestor of #1450's merged head, so its commits are on main in their reviewed and revised form. Its blocking review items were fixed inside #1450: the per-turn starting `Selection` is recorded, the context budget is capped, settings are transactional, and unsupported commands are rejected. References #820.",
